    {
      "chunk_key": "unit-circle",
      "text": "知识点：三角函数。对任意角 θ，可以使用单位圆定义三角函数。角 θ 的终边与单位圆交于点 P(x, y) 时，cos θ = x，sin θ = y；当 cos θ 不为 0 时，tan θ = y ÷ x。单位圆定义把三角函数从锐角推广到任意角。",
      "source_name": "OpenStax（莱斯大学）《Precalculus 2e》",
      "source_url": "https://openstax.org/books/precalculus-2e/pages/5-2-unit-circle-sine-and-cosine-functions",
      "source_locator": "第5章第2节·Unit Circle: Sine and Cosine Functions",
      "metadata": {"subject": "数学", "domain": "三角学", "concept": "三角函数", "grade": "高中", "difficulty": "基础"},
