    {
      "chunk_key": "special-angle-values",
      "text": "知识点：三角函数。常用特殊角的值包括：sin 30° = 1/2，cos 30° = √3/2，tan 30° = √3/3；sin 45° = cos 45° = √2/2，tan 45° = 1；sin 60° = √3/2，cos 60° = 1/2，tan 60° = √3。",
      "source_name": "OpenStax（莱斯大学）《Precalculus 2e》",
      "source_url": "https://openstax.org/books/precalculus-2e/pages/5-4-right-triangle-trigonometry",
      "source_locator": "第5章第4节·Special Angles：30°、45°、60°的精确三角函数值",
      "metadata": {"subject": "数学", "domain": "三角学", "concept": "三角函数", "grade": "初中至高中", "difficulty": "基础"},
