    {
      "chunk_key": "fundamental-identities",
      "text": "知识点：三角函数。常用基本关系包括：sin²θ + cos²θ = 1；当 cos θ 不为 0 时，tan θ = sin θ ÷ cos θ。这些关系可以用于已知一个三角函数值时求其他三角函数值，也可以用于化简表达式。",
      "source_name": "OpenStax（莱斯大学）《Precalculus 2e》",
      "source_url": "https://openstax.org/books/precalculus-2e/pages/5-3-the-other-trigonometric-functions",
      "source_locator": "第5章第3节·The Pythagorean Identity and Other Properties of Sines and Cosines",
      "metadata": {"subject": "数学", "domain": "三角学", "concept": "三角函数", "grade": "高中", "difficulty": "基础"},
